# Subterranean Schooner: two creatures crew it on turn 3, the Llanowar Elves and an Elvish Mystic cast that turn (crewing is no {T} ability, so summoning sickness does
# not matter, CR 702.122c). Both are targets; Bot1 picks the Mystic, which explores (CR 701.44a): the Lightning Bolt on top is a nonland, so the Mystic gets a +1/+1
# counter (a 2/2) and Bot1 puts the Bolt into the graveyard. The Elves are untouched: still a 1/1 with no counter.

